1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,610
Has someone pushed you away?

2
00:00:02,761 --> 00:00:04,231
Told you 'not now'?

3
00:00:05,562 --> 00:00:06,772
This story is for you.

4
00:00:07,902 --> 00:00:10,253
People were bringing young children to Jesus.

5
00:00:10,663 --> 00:00:11,963
They wanted one thing:

6
00:00:11,963 --> 00:00:14,134
"that he should touch them."

7
00:00:15,244 --> 00:00:18,215
But His own close followers "rebuked those that brought them."

8
00:00:18,645 --> 00:00:19,876
They tried to stop them.

9
00:00:20,986 --> 00:00:22,196
Then Jesus saw it.

10
00:00:22,766 --> 00:00:25,677
And the Bible says He was "much displeased."

11
00:00:26,467 --> 00:00:26,958
Angry.

12
00:00:28,008 --> 00:00:29,098
Not with the children.

13
00:00:29,588 --> 00:00:31,419
With the ones who tried to stop them.

14
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:35,310
"Suffer the little children to come unto me, and

15
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:36,200
forbid them not:

16
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,541
for of such is the kingdom of God."

17
00:00:38,911 --> 00:00:39,881
In plain words:

18
00:00:40,571 --> 00:00:41,482
let them come.

19
00:00:42,172 --> 00:00:43,422
Do not stop them.

20
00:00:44,553 --> 00:00:47,243
God's kingdom belongs to people like these children.

21
00:00:48,033 --> 00:00:50,384
And grown-ups must receive it the same way:

22
00:00:51,314 --> 00:00:52,405
like a little child.

23
00:00:53,975 --> 00:00:55,005
And here is what He did.

24
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,676
"He took them up in his arms, put his

25
00:00:58,676 --> 00:01:01,227
hands upon them, and blessed them."

26
00:01:02,718 --> 00:01:04,188
The people came for a touch.

27
00:01:05,138 --> 00:01:06,789
He gave the children His arms.

28
00:01:08,219 --> 00:01:10,130
Someone told you "not now."

29
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:12,750
Look at who Jesus picked up.
